	"data": "Homelab & Self-Hosted Infrastructure\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal's personal server stack — Nextcloud, Home Assistant, Node-RED, Plex, Docker, Raspberry Pi network. The homelab is both the proving ground for Cybernautics products and the nervous system of his daily life. Every major system project eventually connects to it.\n\nCore Stack (from ChatGPT 2023–2024)\n\n| Service | Role |\n|---|---|\n| Nextcloud | Personal cloud: files, CalDAV calendar, tasks, WebDAV |\n| Home Assistant | Home automation hub,…",
